      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>I'm just... I feel like i'm just going through the motions. Like i'm a ghost in my own life. He was my entire world and now that he's gone, there's zero point to any of this. Every morning i wake up and it's just this crushing weight all over again. It feels like it's never going to get better, just more empty.",
